    "description": "Complete financial management module with expense tracking, categories, and comprehensive reports.\n\n**Features:**\n- Expense Management (CRUD)\n- Expense Categories\n- Financial Reports (P&L, Revenue, Expense)\n- Multi-status workflow (draft → pending → approved → paid)\n\n**Date:** December 22, 2025\n**Version:** 1.0.0",
